@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### Home page
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Public list: Aurora, Sentinel
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes

### Registered hero: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Details/1

### Draft hero: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Details/3

### Unknown hero: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Details/999

### Lab 2: the form
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Create

### Lab 2: POST without antiforgery token: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Create
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Codename=NoToken&Race=1&Alignment=1

### Optional A: drafts (Shadowling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Drafts

### Optional A: edit a Draft: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Edit/3

### Optional A: a Registered hero cannot be edited: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Edit/1

### Optional D: the stylesheet from wwwroot: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/css/site.css

### Optional D: only wwwroot is served: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/appsettings.json
